				12
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize all core submodules with documentation refinements and service updates\n\nUpdate 12 core submodules to align documentation with architectural realities, standardize technical formatting, and integrate upstream service changes.\n\n**Documentation Standardization:** Apply consistent inline code formatting (backticks) to technical terms across **Air**, **Common**, **Echo**, **Grove**, **Output**, **Rest**, and **Vine**. Replace generic descriptions with deep-dive architectural narratives in **Air** (three-layer architecture), **Cocoon** (gRPC round-trips), **Echo** (work-stealing logic), and **Sky** (bundled workbench pipeline). Update **Mountain** and **Cocoon** diagrams and file structure references to reflect recent refactoring.\n\n**Service Integration:** **Wind** regenerates interfaces to include the new `IAgentHostDebugLogsExportService`, updated `IChatOutputRendererService` methods, and extended `IAgentHostTerminalManager`, aligning the service layer with upstream VS Code contributions.\n\n**Artifact Synchronization:** Trigger rebuilds in **Output** and **Cocoon** to refresh source maps and route manifests reflecting the updated documentation and build states.\n\nThese changes ensure the project documentation accurately reflects the current codebase structure, improves readability through consistent styling, and keeps the UI service layer synchronized with upstream contracts.",
			"SHA": "c8555c6f65974ae8154b26ffbdc7f99c2d1e61c4"
		}
